'''Almuña''' ({{IPA-bl|alˈmuɲa}}) is one of the nine [[Commune district|legislative districts]] in the [[Cantons of Balisca|canton]]/city of [[Jatiel]], within the [[Luzamontaña]] (33) region. Like the other 735 Baliscan commune districts, it elects one [[Confederal Congress|delegate]] using the [[W:Instant-runoff voting|instant-runoff voting]] system.

